{"id":"n55662-1-8","stage":5,"title":"무시무시하다 · 恐怖","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n55662-1-8-1","ko":"할아버지, 저승사자는 어떻게 생겼어요?","zh":"爷爷，阴间使者长什么样啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"할아버지,","meaning":"爷爷，姥爷","explanation":"할아버지：爷爷，姥爷","readings":[{"term":"할아버지","audio":"/audio/6600340ce9e158e7d903.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74121","senseId":"1","lemma":"할아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저승사자는","meaning":"阴曹使者，阎罗使者","explanation":"저승사자：阴曹使者，阎罗使者；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"저승사자","audio":"/audio/3c51bd230b3b8de15de7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74888","senseId":"1","lemma":"저승사자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생겼어요?","meaning":"长","explanation":"생기다：长；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"생기다","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67898","senseId":"4","lemma":"생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6600340ce9e158e7","term":"할아버지","zh":"爷爷，姥爷","audio":"/audio/6600340ce9e158e7d903.mp3","entryId":"74121","definition":"用于指称或称呼父亲的父亲或母亲的父亲。","pronunciation":["하라버지"]},{"id":"3c51bd230b3b8de1","term":"저승사자","zh":"阴曹使者，阎罗使者","audio":"/audio/3c51bd230b3b8de15de7.mp3","entryId":"74888","definition":"奉阎罗王之命来带死者的灵魂去阴间的跑腿人。","pronunciation":["저승사자"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"fc2a5a2e23bd6357","term":"생기다","zh":"长","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3","entryId":"67898","definition":"人或事物的长相成为某种样子。","pronunciation":["생기다"]}],"audio":"/audio/074bb62b8785b6c4ebd7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n5